Z||000000||MR2KLR||12-01-2001||05:28 PM||||<BR>Perhaps some of you guys have had thies very same problems and could point me in the right direction. <P>#1: Gauges<BR>My tach sits @ 2500 rpm from the moment the key is on, The fuel gauge points to 3 o'clock (way past full) the temp sits @ 100° and will not move from there (while the key is on) The volt gauge & spedo seem to work although the batery light now comes on when the car is running and it seems to read low. I did hook up my multi-meter and it read 12.0v while the car was running at the batt.(should it be more like 14.4?) My oil presure gauge acts odd also. I have a feeling my alternator is or is going bad.<P>#2:<BR>there is a water leak from the front right of the cradle at first I though it was my new fuel filter leaking but its water runing off the cradle from higher up where I can't see. Water pump? do fiero's have weep holes?<P>#3:<BR>It sputers and misses when it warms up and bogs down when I hit the gas (also only when hot). Check engine light is not on<P>#4:<BR>the fan only comes on when I turn on the AC<p>[This message has been edited by MR2KLR (edited 12-01-2001).]||||reg||5
